WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.334
The robot arm approaches the alphabet soup can on the table, grasps it, lifts it, and places it into the white basket on the left. The arm then retracts to the right, leaving the tomato sauce can on the table.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Move arm towards the alphabet soup can and grasp it

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Lift the can and move it to the left towards the basket

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Place the can into the basket and release it

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Retract arm to the right and hold position
